  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">St. Lucia Connect Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with Saint Lucias Department of Education, Innovation and Gender Relations (DEIGR) have designed the Saint Lucia connected program with the goal to build resilience and improve the quality of teaching and learning in Saint Lucia by equipping Saint Lucian youth and educators as digital literacy leaders in their communities.</narrative>
